+# Team Decisions
+
+## Search box lives inside the swapped member-list region
+**Date:** 30. 09. 26
+**Context:** Search swaps `#member-list` as the user types; a successful invite re-renders the
+whole page so the new member shows up. htmx 4's morph only resets an input's live value when
+its `value` attribute changes, so a search box outside the region keeps a stale query after the
+invite while the list below it shows everyone.
+**Decision:** Render the search box inside `#member-list`, with `value` set from the query the
+server filtered by. The invite form resets through `.behavior("resetOnSuccess")`.
+**Reasoning:** Every answer that paints the list also paints the query it was filtered by, so the
+two cannot disagree. The morph keeps the focused input (matched by id) while the user types.
+**Consequences:** The search box is hidden in the empty-team state (nothing to search).
